{"id": "De7WVygSvKl", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "We were kids sharing one pair of earphones. Somehow, we never took them off. 🤍\n\nThis whole reel is one single line that never lifts off the page, the way some loves never do.\nTwo kids on a wall. A thread that wouldn’t let her walk away. A heart that became two hands holding on. A barefoot dance in the grass under string lights.\nShe looks down at her muddy feet, feeling like a mess… and in that moment she’s the only thing in the world in colour.\nAt the end the whole line lights up, every scene still connected. One love, one line, all the way back to the beginning ✨\n\n🎵 Perfect · Ed Sheeran @teddysphotos\n\nSend this to the person your line leads back to.\n\nPerfect Ed Sheeran | Perfect song | Ed Sheeran Perfect animation | romantic English songs | wedding songs | love song animation | one line art | continuous line drawing | childhood love story | animated music video\n\n#Perfect #EdSheeran #OneLineArt #LoveStory #ContinuousLine", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1792952885, "like_count": 234, "comment_count": 2, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-4540653916214269a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 58.621, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNFfSqMQ6iMJzB3iDlo6amt62OmuUKOOD-oVFkcBEIJdmJLEH5NrKKMUjrUWVppqpDBETvumu1k3tGxwZPQS9TNYFP1-WfGyjA2R3E.mp4?_nc_cat=100&_nc_oc=AdqS4yMx6QhdYmnGB6jbaDWGjDhCBVxhkhEVqnemOBd-48rspYZgllrnn7wA718AvSFyI8jVjWpcTwiieiDVzEig&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=wRuxTXKyBDQQ7kNvwFn-MjT&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=OaohgOVGQIuRjZEjPpKV8w&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRndKmAEnIvdvKBqkboFwBPiWs3CNNcO_lPt_UdnFjhcg&oe=6AF43A29", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_